Arc Space by Bruno Bernard (https://github.com/eznix86/herdr-arc-space), Apache-2.0.
This layout is a fork of it. Changes: renamed to arc-ext; a bottom status bar
(machine, git branch, extension buttons); a machine context so each machine's
spaces are separate; a machine picker; Windows and Linux keys; a Firefox-style
Ctrl+Tab most-recently-used switcher; Ctrl+N / Ctrl+P in the launcher and
palette. arc-ext-launcher and arc-ext-palette are copies of Herdr's shipped
terminals layout mods (Apache-2.0) with those changes.

The space icon picker follows Zen Browser's workspace icon picker (emoji tab with
tag search, an icons tab, a None button). Its icon set is Ionicons (MIT,
icon-set/LICENSE-ionicons); the emoji names and tags come from emojibase data via
emoji-picker-element-data (MIT).

mods/branch-issue is a fork of Branch Issue from munza/herdr-mods
(https://github.com/munza/herdr-mods, Apache-2.0). Changes: GitHub Issues is the
default provider (mod.json settings), the Linear helper binary is not shipped, and
github/reads.js accepts SSH host aliases such as github-cic, as Branch PR does.
